OL,3,GNEWSAYoung dolphin given first aid
OL,4,Aafter getting stranded on beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo dolphins spotted thrashing in
OL,7,Fshallow water sparked an emergency
OL,8,Frescue.
OL,10,FThe female common dolphins were
OL,11,Fstranded off Mumbles, Swansea, with one
OL,12,Fgiven first aid by marine mammal medics
OL,13,Fand moved to deeper water on 2
OL,14,FSeptember.
OL,16,FThe other managed to free itself.
OL,18,F"Following advice from our rescue
OL,19,Fcoordinators and veterinary advisor, a
OL,20,Fcarefully controlled refloat was
OL,21,Fauthorised," the British Divers Marine
OL,22,FLife Rescue (BDMLR) said.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
